  "name": "Chunk a Transcript for Indexing",
  "tool_name": null,
  "description": "Split a long passage into overlapping windows the way a RAG ingest does, then count them. `length` and `overlap` are counted in WORDS, not characters — a 90 here would swallow this whole passage into one chunk. Overlap is the point: a boundary landing mid-sentence loses the claim that straddles it, so neighbouring chunks share a tail. Counting needs Collection first, because Count consumes a stream and a list handed to it arrives as a single item.",
  "tags": [
    "text",
    "example"
  ],
  "thumbnail": null,
  "thumbnail_url": null,
  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Chunk a Transcript for Indexing\n\nSplits a passage into overlapping word windows, as a RAG ingest step would, and counts the chunks. Overlap keeps a sentence that crosses a boundary intact in at least one chunk.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Transcript\" holds a short passage. \"2 12 words, 3 overlap\" is a Code node that cuts it into 12-word chunks sharing 3 words. One \"Output\" shows the chunks. \"3 Fan out\" streams them to \"4 How many\", and the second \"Output\" shows the count. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Change length or overlap on the Code node, remembering both count words, not characters."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "zIndex": 0,
          "width": 560,
          "selectable": true,
          "height": 305
        },
        "dynamic_properties": {},
        "dynamic_outputs": {}
      },
      {
        "id": "t",
        "type": "nodetool.constant.String",
        "data": {
          "value": "The keeper climbed the stair each evening. The lamp needed winding twice a night. By the third winter the mechanism had worn, and the light guttered where it had once held steady. Ships began to pass wider of the point."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 672
          },
          "zIndex": 0,
          "width": 280,
          "selectable": true,
          "title": "1  Transcript"
        },
        "dynamic_properties": {},
        "dynamic_outputs": {}
      },
      {
        "id": "ch",
        "type": "nodetool.code.Code",
        "data": {
          "code": "const chunkSize = Number(inputs.length ?? 100);\nconst overlap = Number(inputs.overlap ?? 0);\nconst separator = String(inputs.separator ?? \" \");\nconst words = String(inputs.text ?? \"\").split(separator);\nconst step = chunkSize - overlap;\nconst chunks = [];\nfor (let i = 0; i < words.length; i += step) {\n  chunks.push(words.slice(i, i + chunkSize).join(separator));\n}\nreturn { output: chunks };",
          "packages": []
        },
        "ui_properties": {
